        "created_at": "2018-03-15T23:37:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Knowing that Tempest is among the most hot-headed of his species, I present a Maerynian joke.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Three Maerynians are sat at home when a fish swins by the window.</p><p>A day later, one of them says, \"I think that was a cod.\"</p><p>The next day, the second replies, \"No, it was a haddock.\"</p><p>The day after, the third says, \"Everybody calm down, you don't need to fight about it!\"</p>",
