        "id": 215246,
        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-03-16T06:50:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Okay, was I the only one entirely creeped out by Maerynian reproduction? This was not the hot alien nookie I was waiting for.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It reminded me of the&nbsp; Uryuoms from El Goonish Shive.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Also, Humanity First! is the name of the anti-mutant faction in the Whateley Universe webfiction series.&nbsp; So this was the week of unintentional (probably?) webfiction references, to me at least.</p>",
